{{Stat|timber}} is a {{Skl|Foraging}} [[stat]]. It increases the chance of felling an entire tree on the first melee axe cut.

== Timber Mechanics == 
For every {{Stat|timber|1}} the player has, they gain a {{Green|1%}} chance to fell an entire tree on the first melee axe cut. Felling an entire tree causes the {{Stat|swp}} animation to play until the tree is destroyed and a [[Tree Gift]] is rewarded. The player can still continue to cut the tree during the animation.

