* Any [[Axe]] ({{Stat|timber|+1.02|icononly=yes}})
** {{Ench|Petalfall V}}
** {{Green|Axed}} [[Forest Essence Shop]] perk
* [[Heart of the Forest]]
** {{AN|Timber}} ({{Stat|timber|+1|icononly=yes}})

The maximum possible {{Stat|timber}} is '''{{Dark Red|2.02}}''', or with {{Attr|Helix Timber X}} is '''{{Dark Red|3.02}}''' on [[Helix Log|Helix]] Trees.

