==Trivia==
*It is the only [[Foraging Stat]] that isn't disabled by default on the player's [[Private Island]].
**Comparatively, {{stat|BPC}} is the only [[Farming Stat]] that isn't disabled by default on the player's [[Private Island]].
* {{stat|Speed}}, {{stat|Attack Speed}}, {{stat|Ferocity}}, {{stat|Swing Range}}, {{stat|Mining Spread}}, {{stat|Gemstone Spread}}, {{stat|Timber}}, {{stat|Fishing Speed}}, {{stat|Trophy Chance}}, {{stat|Treasure Chance}}, {{stat|Magic Find}} and {{stat|Charm Chance}} are the only stats with a cap.

